subckt dut (VEE VSS TUNE OUT)
C1 (net0 net1) capacitor c=1p
C2 (net1 VEE) capacitor c=1p
C4 (net5 VEE) capacitor c=1p
L1 (net4 net0) inductor l=1n
L2 (net6 OUT) inductor l=1n
Q1 (net6 net0 net1 VEE) sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00 m=1
Q2 (net4 net5 net5 VEE) sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00 m=1
R1 (VSS net0) resistor r=1k
R2 (net0 VEE) resistor r=1k
R3 (VSS net6) resistor r=1k
R4 (net1 VEE) resistor r=1k
R6 (TUNE net5) resistor r=1k
